      "contextAfter": "```xml\n<rules>\n    <specialize state=\"({progress}-greater-than:0) and ({progress}-less-than:1)\">\n        <button tag=\"button\">\n            <text>Resume</text>\n        </button>\n    </specialize>\n    <specialize state=\"({progress}:0), ({progress}:1)\">\n        <button tag=\"button\">\n            <text>Play</text>\n        </button>\n    </specialize>\n</rules>\n```",
